    <string name="cast_airplay_instructions">1. Connect iPhone, iPad or Mac to the same Wi-Fi network as TV.\n2. Open Control Center and tap \'Screen Mirroring\'.\n3. Select Smart TV to mirror your screen.\n4. Use AirScreen for hardware-accelerated AirPlay reception.</string>
