    <string name="cast_miracast_instructions">1. Open \'Smart View\' (Samsung) or \'Wireless Display\' (Android/Windows).\n2. Select Smart TV to mirror your screen directly.\n3. If your TV lacks hardware Wi-Fi Direct sink, AirScreen provides software Miracast receiver.\n4. PIN on screen is NOT needed for Miracast / DLNA — it is strictly for the web remote on the left.</string>
